; Adjective
* {{a|RP}}, {{IPA|en|/ˈfɔː.nɪ.kət/}}
* {{a|GA}}, {{IPA|en|/ˈfɔɹ.nɪ.kət/}}
; Verb
* {{a|RP}}, {{IPA|en|/ˈfɔː.nɪˌkeɪt/}}
* {{a|GA}}, {{IPA|en|/ˈfɔɹ.nɪˌkeɪt/}}

